{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你真的很沒用欸。那樣還算是美羽學姊的男朋友嗎？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1689", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真奇怪。她明明有說今天會來社團的……」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我打算再跟學姊談一次社團的事。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪也贊同，所以我們才會在這裡等著學姊。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「根本沒來嘛。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1690", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……打電話給她比較快吧？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1691", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才打過了，但是轉語音信箱。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是破局的前奏吧。」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1692", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可能不可能。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種事我知道啦。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1693", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以？你有想好說服學姊的說法了吧？」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1694", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？不是紗凪要說服她嗎？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1695", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「開玩笑的啦、開玩笑！不要那個表情嘛。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就算我來說服，學姊也不會聽的。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1696", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那種事吧？」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是有那種事啦！」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1697", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀……你們在這種地方做什麼？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "ar4500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，愛理妳來得正好。妳有沒有看到美羽學姊？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1698", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊的話，剛才在校門口有看到她喔。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "ar4501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她說有事要去學園長室一趟……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "ar4502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼！？」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1699", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長室，該不會……」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是要去報告即將結束社團嗎？", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是這樣，必須阻止她……", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，要衝進學園長室了！」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1700", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、等等……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "ar4503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『小紗凪，妳知道嗎？動物們能夠理解人類的語言喔。』", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『雖然大家都取笑不相信……』", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『但是啊，只要好好地注視著眼睛說話，我們的心意就能相通喔！』", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『所以，我……』", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『想成為能夠直視著動物們的眼睛的人。』", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『如果現在別開視線，我覺得我就沒辦法那樣做了……』", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……雖然你們說要保護動物。』", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0650", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『但是今後會發生什麼事呢？』", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0651", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……希望妳有一天能跟那個人一起生活。』", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "yk0236", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那個重要的人。』", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "yk0237", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『然後，跟最喜歡的孩子們一起……』", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "yk0238", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，好久不見。怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0652", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有一件事想拜託瀨名學園長……」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜託？」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0653", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊哈啊……新吾、快點！」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1701", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要快點的是妳吧？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、你居然能跑那麼快……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1702", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之快點去學園長室！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1703", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！美羽學姊！」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1704", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走廊的另一端，學姊正好從學園長室走出來。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪大步跑向學姊。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪……連新吾君也……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們有重要的話要跟學姊說！」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1705", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「重要的話？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2455", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平復了一下呼吸後，我也走向學姊。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「難道已經向學園長報告了嗎？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1706", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2456", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊不解地歪著頭。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我聽紗凪說了。學姊想關閉社團的理由。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我想跟妳討論一下，能不能想個辦法讓救助動物的活動繼續下去。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算美羽學姊畢業，我們也想繼續這個社團。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1707", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，我們……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2457", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……謝謝你們。不過，我不是去找瀨名學園長說那件事的。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2458", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼妳是去說了什麼事呢？」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1708", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2459", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以，天羽同學的想法是？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0326", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0654", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她希望可以舉辦植樹活動，作為學校新課外活動的一環……」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0655", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「植樹？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0327", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，說得那麼簡單～」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0656", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……預、預算上有點難度呢，植樹這種活動。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0328", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，想辦法解決這種大人的因素本來就是我們的責任啦～」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0657", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長……」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0329", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要成為好女人，不是只要學業成績優秀就好。」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0658", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學問與女性的成績，還有戀愛的成績也很重要呢。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0330", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真會說呢，妳這個單身貴族～♪」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0659", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我又不是自己喜歡才單身的……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0331", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人不管多麼努力，還是得要有看男人的眼光才行呢……」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0660", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是說啊就是說啊！」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0332", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼萬智，要工作囉！為了可愛的學生們。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 430, "voice": "rk0661", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，學園長！」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mc0333", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「復育大自然？」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我考慮了很多，然後想到這個。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2460", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算在這裡繼續救助動物們，結果還是沒有改變任何事……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2461", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，社團會繼續存在吧？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是這麼打算的。不過，只有保護是不行的。必須創造新的做法……」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2462", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓幾年後、幾十年後……我們救助過的動物，以及牠們的孩子們……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2463", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊望向社團教室附近的供養塔。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓小熊喵牠們，能夠有個安心生活的場所。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2464", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊此時此刻的笑容，真的好耀眼。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旁的紗凪也露出同樣的笑容。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我也笑了──", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，我能做的事……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咔擦！」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2465", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊突然拿出手機拍了我。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼回事？突然拍我……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿嘿，我想說重要的東西要仔細地保存♪」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2466", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也來咔擦。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn1710", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪看起來有點不爽地拿出手機。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連我也不自覺想拿出自己的手機，但是手伸到一半就停下了。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼事，新吾君？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2467", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然想到。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有沒有用不輸給她的愛來愛她呢？", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有沒有像這個人愛我一樣，同等地愛她呢？", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「關於我們社團今後的事。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2468", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我注意到的時候，其他人也都來到社團教室外了。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔似乎想說什麼，但被瀨名同學摀住了嘴巴。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃則是一如往常的平靜表情。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到大家的態度，我放鬆了下來。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不必想得那麼複雜。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊畢業以後，我可以繼任社長嗎？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2469", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果大家願意繼續救助動物，那就由我來保護大家。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我要守護學姊創立的社團。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2470", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu2471", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊對我綻放了最燦爛的笑容。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_33.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我別無所求了。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
